      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Scope: checked-in SQL, generated IaC views, materialization procedures and named application readers. Live project-wide view inventory was denied; ad hoc external BI views are not enumerated. Arrows show data dependencies; scheduler calls are labelled separately.",
